 "about_text": "Tyler Park Presents is a contemporary art gallery founded in September 2020 by Tyler Park, originally housed in a converted apartment in Los Angeles's Silver Lake neighborhood. The gallery represents and exhibits emerging and established artists working across painting, photography, sculpture, and mixed media, staging six to seven exhibitions a year, including solo and group presentations. It has built a track record of organizing artists' first solo exhibitions in Los Angeles, with nearly half of its solo shows marking such debuts. The gallery participates regularly in art fairs including NADA, Future Fair, Material Art Fair, Felix Art Fair, and Frieze Los Angeles, and is a member of the New Art Dealers Alliance. It is planning to relocate to the Melrose Hill neighborhood in September 2026.",
